      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. so if the UN is basically just a tool for more powerful countries to push their own agendas while the smaller ones get ignored, isn't it more realistic to say that global governance is actually a threat to real independence? like, can it ever actually work if it's fundamentally built to undermine the nation-state?",
