      "role": "user",
      "content": "i see. so you're saying it's basically an impossible system. if the foundation itself is broken like that, then what's the point of even having these organizations? isn't it better for countries to just focus on bilateral deals and strong borders rather than wasting time on these ineffective global institutions?",
